&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Communications, Project Management, or a related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS platforms, higher education, or student housing is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in higher education, student housing, or technology implementation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the needs and challenges of university administrators and students in the housing search process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
