&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;About StarRez&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;StarRez is the global leader in student housing software, providing innovative solutions for on and off-campus housing management, resident wellness and experience, and revenue generation. Trusted by 1,400+ clients across 25+ countries, StarRez supports more than 4 million beds annually with its user-friendly, all-in-one platform, delivering seamless experiences for students and administrators. With offices in the United States, Australia, the UK, and India, StarRez blends the robust capabilities of a global organization with the personalized care and service of a trusted partner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for a Senior&amp;nbsp;UI/UX&amp;nbsp;Designer to join&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;College Pads team in&amp;nbsp;Hyderabad, India.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is not a typical design role.&amp;nbsp;It’s&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;role with&amp;nbsp;ownership, real&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;and high visibility. You will&amp;nbsp;be initially&amp;nbsp;optimising&amp;nbsp;the current&amp;nbsp;College Pads&amp;nbsp;platform and&amp;nbsp;in the future&amp;nbsp;transition&amp;nbsp;to working on&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;AI first&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;platform.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;partmer&amp;nbsp;closely with Product and Engineering to&amp;nbsp;experiment to&amp;nbsp;learn&amp;nbsp;fast, and&amp;nbsp;iterate&amp;nbsp;optimising&amp;nbsp;user journeys for&amp;nbsp;outstanding user&amp;nbsp;experience and lead conversion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll take ownership of high-impact product design challenges, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;shaping&amp;nbsp;lead-based user journeys and&amp;nbsp;complex operational systems into intuitive, accessible experiences used by&amp;nbsp;students and&amp;nbsp;administrators around the world.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This is a high-ownership senior independent contributor role: you’ll influence product direction within your domain, elevate design quality across initiatives, and help mature a growing global design practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for a designer with strong experience in B2B2C products, ideally in lead-based environments where acquisition, conversion, engagement, and monetization are tightly connected. You bring deep strength in UX research and experimentation, and you use data, customer insight, and sound judgment to shape solutions.&amp;nbsp;You’re&amp;nbsp;curious about AI and emerging tools,&amp;nbsp;however&amp;nbsp;grounded in a problem-first mindset and thoughtful about when they create real value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
